# A file whose last record is truncated: ipmi_sdr_read_records()
# reports `SDR from ... truncated' and abandons the whole queue.

@sdr/sd_full_temp.hex
78 56        # record ID 0x5678
51           # SDR version
02           # record type 02h
1f           # declares 31 body bytes ...
20 00 1c 1d  # ... but only four are present
